# Canonical skills and rules (analytics workspace)

This workspace is a **meta git**. Nested product repos own the bodies. Do not add a full `SKILL.md`, `RULE.md`, or `.mdc` body at this workspace root for IAP or WebUI work.

| Area | Canonical home |
|------|----------------|
| C# / LAP / IAP backend | `MicroService.IAP/MicroService.IAP/.cursor/` (`rules/`, `skills/`) |
| WebUI frontend | `Web/WebUI/.agents/` (`RULES/`, `IMAP/SKILLS/`) and `Web/WebUI/.cursor/rules/` |

## When adding or changing a skill or rule

1. Write the **full body** in the matching product repo above.
2. At analytics, add only a **thin wrapper** (link + when-to-read) under `.cursor/rules/` or `.agents/skills/`.
3. Add one row to root [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md). Do not copy the body.

Wrapper pattern: see [`csharp-code-style.mdc`](csharp-code-style.mdc) → `MicroService.IAP/MicroService.IAP/.cursor/rules/csharp-code-style.mdc`.

## Allowed to live only here

Rules that govern the **workspace itself** (this file). Product indexing (Codebase Memory) lives in IAP/Web; this root only points.

Do not invent a second copy of a product skill/rule at analytics root.
